              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Native foot have Mixed Weapons and shield. Light Infantry. Warband rule #5. May exchange Mixed Weapons and shield for hand weapon and composite bow (-1).</characteristic>
